Content: # One Drill - Fiber & Utility Solutions

## Fiber & Utility Solutions

### Directional Drilling

We are experts in the accurate placement of conduit and cables using Horizontal Directional Drilling (HDD). HDD is a trenchless technology that is safe, accurate, and cost-effective, minimizing the impact on the surrounding environment.

### Cable Burial

We provide direct cable burial, utilizing various trenching techniques.

### Conduit Installation

We provide conduit installation, including conduit to support multiple operator access throughout the network.

### Fiber Splicing

Expert fiber splicing ensures seamless connectivity in networks, offering precision fusion and mechanical splices for reliable, high-performance fiber optic connections.

### Fiber Design & Engineering

We provide design and engineering services for fiber optic networks, including full network design, route planning, and construction documentation.

### Project Management

We provide professional project management services to ensure your project is completed on time and within budget.

